// IntroString :
"P1866969439" "I've got a whole pack of missing people for you to find. It seems some New Age meditation group disappeared inside some local caves. According to the one member who escaped, they had been drawn to that place by their meditations. Before he ran for it, he saw some strange, shambling forms and a witch doctor. Now, here's the strange part: this group's been under investigation for possible connections to the Circle of Thorns. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Could you go to the caves and find the missing group?</A> You only have 90 minutes to find the victims."
// AcceptString :
"P2059538910" "Go into the caves and find the missing group"
// SendOffString :
"P2313221469" "This might get complex if the Circle of Thorns really does have a connection to this group. Just remember that your primary objective is to find these people before something happens to them. Fighting witch doctors or anything else is secondary."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P310214036" "Find missing New Age group"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P267063858" "You need to rescue that New Age group before something happens to them. You don't have a lot of time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2978669677" "A crystal pendant lies on the ground. Beside it, a trail of footprints leads deeper into the caves."

