"P1958807686" "This metal case is just large enough to hold a small book. Its surface is dented from dozens of impacts, and the inside is etched with faded wards."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1673410531" "Some Banished Pantheon worshippers stole a number of Civil War antiques from the Paragon City Museum. According to the curator, those antiques belonged to a group of soldiers assigned to battle a strange outbreak of witchcraft during the 1860's. The items were all rumored to be magical wards or talismans of some kind. After reading some accounts, that outbreak sounds a lot like the work of the Pantheon's cultists. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to recover those antiques from the Banished Pantheon, {HeroName}.</A> Whatever they're planning, I want it stopped before it begins. In order to do so, you'll have to act quickly. I doubt you'll have more than an hour to recover everything."
// AcceptString :
"P1601433979" "Recover the  antiques from the Banished Pantheon"
// SendOffString :
"P3215056445" "Any power those antiques may have had is probably long gone by now, but studying them could help the Pantheon's cultists to overcome such protections in the future. You must recover all four of them before the Pantheon can learn too much."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2366863488" "Recover antiques from Pantheon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3668136412" "It's important that you get all four of those antiques back before the Banished Pantheon can use them for some nefarious purpose."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1255654528" "As you ready yourself to face the forces of the Banished Pantheon, you think of how brave those Civil War soldiers must have been to battle the Banished Pantheon's cult with no super powers."

