// IntroString :
"P3928875064" "Several mystical and occult researchers have recently disappeared while attending a conference on early human religions. The surviving security guard's description points to the culprits being the Banished Pantheon. Fortunately, I have a lead on where they may be holding the kidnap victims. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Someone has to track down the Pantheon and rescue those mystics.</A> There won't be much time, maybe 75 minutes at most before the Pantheon completes their sacrifices. Can you do it?"
// AcceptString :
"P615598738" "Track down the Pantheon and rescue the mystics"
// SendOffString :
"P3380455675" "You'll need to find all of the occult researchers and rescue all of them from the Banished Pantheon. I fear the only way to preserve their safety in the long term will be to defeat all of the Pantheon's creatures who took part in the researcher's abduction. Move fast. No one survives in the Pantheon's clutches for long."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P94694018" "Defeat all Pantheon cultists"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1962068264" "You've got to save those occultists! Time is running out!"
// TaskTitle :
"P4157841734" "Find the Pantheon: Rescue the Mystics"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P290532641" "You feel like you're being watched, and not by a human being. It feels like an otherworldly presence, one that watches with an unspeakable hunger."

