// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_BanishedP_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P339052975" "I hate to ask this of you, but the more I hear about Dark Astoria, the more worried I become. The entire zone is overrun with the walking dead creations of the Banished Pantheon. Recently, the reports from the few brave souls who dared to enter have spoken of unspeakable hordes of the Pantheon's creatures. If the city is ever to reclaim Astoria, it will only be through the concerted efforts of it's heroes. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you enter Dark Astoria and combat the hordes of the undead?</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P3022454528" "Go to Dark Astoria and combat the undead"
// SendOffString :
"P955178234" "You might want to concentrate your efforts on Moth Cemetery or Dido's View. Those neighborhoods are simply overrun."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2388676919" "Combat Pantheon in Dark Astoria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4091042156" "You must go to Dark Astoria and fight the Banished Pantheon who dwell there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2782114369" "You have defeated enough of the Banished Pantheon in Dark Astoria."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1418944574" "Thousands were buried in Moth Cemetery, including many of the city's veterans. It's a tragedy that the Banished Pantheon now uses their bodies to wreak havoc on the city they once fought to protect."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_BanishedP_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P646686616" "Mystically connected contacts of mine are getting disturbing images of a great change overcoming all of Dark Astoria. They think it must have something to do with the Banished Pantheon. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I hesitate to ask you, but can you go to Dark Astoria and battle the Banished Pantheon there?</A> "
// AcceptString :
"P2903069646" "Go to Dark Astoria and defeat Banished Pantheon"
// SendOffString :
"P1661233841" "Dark Astoria is awash in the forces of the Banished Pantheon, so finding them should not be difficult. Toffet Terrace and Barca Plaza are especially overrun."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3535070764" "Defeat Pantheon in Dark Astoria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3482384081" "You must take the fight to Dark Astoria and defeat the Banished Pantheon there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3543108790" "You have cleared out enough Banished Pantheon in Dark Astoria."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P133960255" "None of my contacts can say what it was they feared happening in Dark Astoria, {HeroName}, but all are certain that your actions helped to prevent something awful from occurring. Often, such things are subtle, but we can still take our victories from them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_BanishedP_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3188670711" "I've become very concerned of late about the activities of the Banished Pantheon. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I know that it's a dangerous thing, but I feel I must ask you to cull the numbers of the the Banished Pantheon.</A> They are becoming a real threat to this city."
// AcceptString :
"P1370415100" "Cull the numbers of the Banished Pantheon"
// SendOffString :
"P3711526520" "The Banished Pantheon are a plague on the city, and Dark Astoria is one of the places they've hit hardest. Be careful, and take the fight back to them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2097203791" "Combat Banished Pantheon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3379888636" "You must take the fight to the Banished Pantheon. I know you can do it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1845138392" "You have defeated enough of the Banished Pantheon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1572618076" "The Pantheon's depredations grow more heinous by the day. If it wasn't for the efforts of heroes like you, they would spread through the city like a plague."

